# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

# IDE / editor
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Git
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Secrets and local config (never bake into image)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/secrets.json

# Docker meta (not needed inside image)
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Docs
**/README.md
**/*.md

# OS junk
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
